# Drift maps

The six named drift parts are Owners, Code map, Feature map, Tutorial manifest, Blast radius, and Gates. Paths and the lockstep gate live in `docs/testing-gauntlet.md`. Do not collapse them.

Owners live in `tools/file-map.mjs`. Generate `docs/file-map.md`, `docs/code-map.md`, `docs/feature-map.md`, `docs/tutorial-manifest.md`, and `docs/effect-map.md`. Do not hand-edit those markdown files.

Before an edit, look up the name with `node tools/blast-radius.mjs --word …`. The lookup itself does not fail a build.

Declare a new file in the file-map table in the same change that creates it.

Player-facing work must extend JSON Schema plus Ajv tests and a Playwright spec/fixture in the same change. Schema is the authority path for content, config, saves, and UI contracts.

Never add LLM, agent, or network-model calls to `src/`. Follow `/workflows` for content work. Kid-facing copy and images require a human gate.
